!/new/*/reports/01_clean_feature_comparison/figures/macro_f1_bootstrap_ci.png

# The readiness tables/JSON are public status data; verbose operational notes
# link to excluded runtime and provenance internals.
/new/*/reports/02_attack_defense_readiness/*.md

# The root result hub is the public entry point; run READMEs contain links to
# intentionally excluded runtime and archive internals.
/new/README.md
/new/*/README.md

